{"code":"215790","name":"이노인스트루먼트","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"통신장비","sector_desc":"통신망 장비·부품. 통신사 설비 투자(5G·6G) 시기에 실적이 집중됩니다.","desc":"동사는 2007년 설립되어 광융착 접속기를 제조·판매·수출하며, 2017년 코스닥시장에 상장함. 중국, 북미, 유럽, 중동 등 전 세계에 광섬유 융착접속기, 절단기 등을 공급하고 있으며, 중국·미국·유럽·인도법인 등 13개 종속회사를 보유하고 있음. 동사는 광통신 토털 솔루션 기업으로 도약하기 위해 OTDR, Power Analyzer 제품군 개발을 지속하고, 중국법인 생산 및 직접 생산을 통해 원가 경쟁력을 확보하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-16","n_days":300,"close":666.0,"open":666.0,"high":666.0,"low":666.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":-2.6316,"ret_60":-18.8794,"ret_120":-76.0432,"ret_250":54.5244,"ma20":678.55,"ma60":717.8,"ma120":1129.5833,"ma200":1008.095,"close_vs_ma200":-33.9348,"close_vs_ma60":-7.2165,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-63.7365,"r2_60":0.3755,"slope_120":-94.5223,"r2_120":0.8363,"slope_250":85.3883,"r2_250":0.1093,"high52":5080.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":13.1102,"dd_52w":-86.8898,"mdd_1y":-85.7834,"atr14_pct":40.1223,"vol_ann_60":117.9829,"vol_avg20":1987508.1,"vol_ratio20":0.0,"vr5":0.0,"vr20":0.2282,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":1445173255.75,"amount_avg60":2139624224.6333,"obv_chg20":39.6063,"turnover_20":98.6769,"pv_eff_20":-0.0267,"rsi14":47.0074,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":106996.0,"inst_net_20":-14478.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.2656,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0359,"smart_net_20_pct":0.2297,"frgn_net_60":-1226877.0,"inst_net_60":13000.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-3.0456,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0323,"smart_net_60_pct":-3.0134,"frgn_net_120":-486582.0,"inst_net_120":13000.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-1.2079,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0323,"smart_net_120_pct":-1.1756,"foreign_ratio":6.45,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-2.13,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":33.0,"op_margin_q":33.3333,"op_qoq":1200.0,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":375.0,"rev_yoy":-25.5639,"op_trend_4q":83.1746,"fin_period":"202606","roe":2.14,"debt_ratio":84.84,"per":33.3,"pbr":0.67,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rat